{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/20940-metatron-for-president","id":20940,"title":"Metatron for President!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-30T19:36:05-08:00","id":20940,"title":"Metatron for President!","content":"Here's a plot seed I came up with after reading the preview. I'd appreciate any feedback you have:<br /> <br /> It's August 13, 2015, and Wade Hampton has just won the Iowa Straw Poll for the 2016 Republican Presidential Primary. Hampton is a retired general in the US Army, the former mayor of Fayetteville, North Carolina, and the establishment pick for the Republican nomination. He's also a very powerful Messenger Integrator. Hampton has no interest in political power itself, he just thinks that having the President as an utterly loyal ally will be useful enough to the God-Machine to let him back in. If he's right, his victory would be catastrophic for every Demon. But most Demons believe the government is totally controlled by the God-Machine anyway, and see the election as irrelevant. The PCs think otherwise, and it's up to them to prevent Hampton's victory. Which could mean anything from a simple assassination to being elected President themselves. The game starts just after the Straw Poll and ends on January 20, 2017, just after the winner is sworn into office. Some NPCs:<br /> <br /> Wade Hampton, Demon presidential candidate<br /> Mr Clout, the pre-eminent Washington DC Tempter. The election may be irrelevant, but he takes a dim view of any activity by the PCs that might draw the attention of Angels.<br /> Angels, whose attention will be drawn.<br /> The Crawford Group, the loosely organised federal government equivalent to the Deva Corporation. A dozen high-ranking military, law-enforcement, and intelligence officials who are collaborating with the current President in absolute secrecy to fight the God-Machine and the Angels. Unfortunately for the PCs, they're also fighting the Demons. They'll either welcome the new President into their group if they think he's human, or try to kill him if they think he's something else.<br /> Mr Knife, Destroyer Saboteur. He takes the majority Demon view of the government to its logical conclusion, and sees federal politicians as just more Infrastructure to attack. He can't distinguish between human and Demon candidates.<br /> And, of course the human candidates themselves. Including the current real-world favourite, Hillary Clinton.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1430-gareth3","name":"Gareth3","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T20:08:57-08:00","id":20953,"title":"","content":"Interesting plot seed.<br /> <br /> The thread title made me expect it was going to be a crossover with His Dark Materials, though.<br /> ...which, maybe, could actually work, with effort. *looks around shiftily*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T22:19:33-08:00","id":21001,"title":"","content":"Wow, I had exactly this idea the other day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-01T02:13:47-08:00","id":21070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/20940-metatron-for-president?p=21001#post21001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, I had exactly this idea the other day.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I suppose it's the obvious extension of that bit about Integrators joining hierarchies to curry favour with the GM. I'd be interested in fleshing it out a bit, lthough I probably wouldn't be able to run it. Some questions:<br /> Is Wade Hampton's plan going to work? Is the US President a valuable ally for the GM, or a meaningless puppet who it controls already?<br /> Should a PC run for President? On one hand, all Demons are perfect liars. On the other hand, do you want News Corp and CNN spending millions to destroy your Cover? Either way, only one PC should run, with the others supporting him or her. Maybe a second could run for VP. You probably need a few Pacts to get a biography that's impressive enough.<br /> Should real-life politicians be used? I was sort of kidding about Hillary Clinton. It's probably better to use real politicians as background characters, and make up the active NPCs from scratch. Just say Clinton decided not to run. Obama is still the current President, but he remains offscreen.<br /> What about real-life political issues intruding on the game? I'd handle this by focussing on the goal - stop Hampton getting elected. If a reporter asks about gay marriage, the answer shouldn't be the player's opinion or even the character's opinion, but whatever serves your real purpose.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1430-gareth3","name":"Gareth3","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}